    notes: 'Tactics Ogre: Reborn - Health Damage module for Nightmare Table Editor\nDo not edit the top row with this module; though it is valid for editing, its fields have different value types and is only present here to preserve the correct ID for other rows.\nField names and visibility were changed to reflect the default configuration values in the top row.\nRows seem to be in pairs: first is an attacker configuration, and next is the defender configuration for that attacker type.',

